   <RCLAS>CityStreet</RCLAS>
   <RDISP>The Brindlewick green</RDISP>
   <RDESC><VARIES><NIGHT>Lantern light spills from the smithy door and the gate across the trodden grass.</NIGHT><ELSE>Sun lies warm on the trodden grass.</ELSE></VARIES> Three low stone buildings face the green: a smithy to the north, the village gate to the east and a well house with a sagging roof to the south.</RDESC>
