   <ROOMID>Brindlewick#1</ROOMID>
   <RAREA>Brindlewick</RAREA>
   <RCLAS>StoneRoom</RCLAS>
   <RDISP>Harl`s smithy</RDISP>
   <RDESC><VARIES><QUESTWON harls_hammer>Harl`s old forge hammer hangs on its hook again, and the smithy rings with work.</QUESTWON><ELSE>An empty hook hangs above the anvil, where a hammer should be.</ELSE></VARIES> Heat shimmers over the forge. Racks of tongs and half-finished hinges line the walls, and a narrow door in the north wall leads to the storeroom.</RDESC>
